    "detailed_description": "<strong>The First Steps Towards the Unknown</strong><br><br>The story of Rune Monsters takes place in the coastal village of Suncrest. It is here that Alex, a young man/woman that has found themselves thrust into a situation that results in their temporary exile, begins their journey. Although eager to finally venture outside of their village for the first time in their life, they soon find themselves embroiled with a conflict that the fate of the world hinges on the conclusion of. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a variety of characters and monsters, both serving as valuable allies and dangerous opponents.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>- A 2.5D aesthetic reminiscent of oldschool games.<br>- Over a hundred different monsters to battle, collect, and fuse together.<br>- An engaging story with charming characters in a world full of wonders.<br>- An old man that loves to walk around in a fish costume?...",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The First Steps Towards the Unknown</strong><br><br>The story of Rune Monsters takes place in the coastal village of Suncrest. It is here that Alex, a young man/woman that has found themselves thrust into a situation that results in their temporary exile, begins their journey. Although eager to finally venture outside of their village for the first time in their life, they soon find themselves embroiled with a conflict that the fate of the world hinges on the conclusion of. Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a variety of characters and monsters, both serving as valuable allies and dangerous opponents.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>- A 2.5D aesthetic reminiscent of oldschool games.<br>- Over a hundred different monsters to battle, collect, and fuse together.<br>- An engaging story with charming characters in a world full of wonders.<br>- An old man that loves to walk around in a fish costume?...",
    "short_description": "A unique spin of the RPG monster collecting genre; taking inspiration from the classics. With over a hundred different monsters to collect, there exists a number of possibilities to choose from as you explore a world full of adventure, and untold dangers.",
